UPDATE chapter SET html = html || '<p>Well, you''ve made it through, she said, holding both my hands tightly. I''ve been here for the past two hours. You have no idea what a state I''ve been in all day. I know, I know. But let''s get down to business. Do you know why I came? Not to talk nonsense like yesterday. Here''s the thing. We need to act more sensibly from now on. I thought a lot about this last night.</p>
