<p>Since there''s no one I can ask, you''ll have to tell me yourself. So what kind of person are you? Come on, start from the beginning. Tell me your whole story. My story? I repeated nervously. My story? But who said I have a story? I don''t have one. Then how have you lived if you don''t have a story? She asked, laughing. I''ve lived without any story at all.</p>
