<p>I''ve even married a Chinese prince in my dreams. But sometimes dreaming is a good thing. Though goodness knows it''s better when you have something real to think about instead, she added, her tone suddenly more serious. Wonderful. If you''ve been married to a Chinese emperor, then you''ll understand me perfectly. Come, listen. Oh, but wait a moment. I don''t even know your name yet. Finally! You sure took your time thinking of that.</p>
