<p>Yes, yes, Nastenka responded eagerly. That''s exactly it. You''re describing it all so wonderfully, but couldn''t you maybe tone it down just a little? You sound like you''re reading a story straight out of a book. Nastenka, I said in a mock serious tone, trying not to laugh. Dear Nastenka, I know I describe things splendidly, but forgive me, I don''t know how else to do it. Right now, Nastenka, I feel like the spirit of King Solomon when, after being locked away in an urn sealed with seven seals for a thousand years, those seals were finally broken.</p>
