<p>All my life, Nastenka, I replied, my voice heavy with resignation. All my life. And it feels as though I''m destined to live that way until the very end. No, that won''t do, she said quickly, her uneasiness plain. That must not be. And if I think about it, maybe I''ll spend my whole life beside my grandmother, too. But do you know? It''s not right to live like that.</p>
