<p>You would have taken care of her, wouldn''t you? You would have understood that she was alone, that she didn''t know how to protect herself, that she didn''t know how to guard her heart from loving you? It wouldn''t have been her fault, would it? You wouldn''t have made her feel like it was her fault? Her voice broke again, and she trailed off into a whisper. Oh, dear! Oh, dear! Nastenka! I cried, my voice raw with emotion.</p>
