<p>Why are you—why are you so suddenly— She broke off, her cheeks flushing a deep crimson. Her eyes dropped, and she fidgeted nervously, clearly at a loss for words. I could see that my confession had shaken her, though she was trying her best to hide it. What''s to be done, Nastenka? What am I to do now? I said, my voice trembling under the weight of my emotions. I know I''m to blame.</p>
